    "Order by urgency" : {
      "comment" : "Settings: the switch that puts the account closest to a limit first.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nach Dringlichkeit ordnen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ordenar por urgencia"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trier par urgence"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊急度順に並べる"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "긴급한 순서로 정렬"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ordenar por urgência"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按紧急程度排序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The account closest to a limit goes first, everywhere accounts are listed. Off, the order is yours: hold a card on the Dashboard and drag it." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: the footnote under the Order by urgency switch.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Account, der einem Limit am nächsten ist, kommt zuerst, überall, wo Accounts aufgeführt sind. Aus, bleibt die Reihenfolge deine: Halte eine Karte im Dashboard gedrückt und ziehe sie."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La cuenta más cerca de un límite va primero, en todos los lugares donde se listan las cuentas. Apagado, el orden es tuyo: mantén pulsada una tarjeta en el panel y arrástrala."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le compte le plus proche d'une limite passe en premier, partout où les comptes sont listés. Désactivé, l'ordre est le vôtre : maintenez une carte du tableau de bord et faites-la glisser."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上限に最も近いアカウントが、アカウントの一覧があるすべての場所で先頭に来ます。オフにすると順序は自分で決められます。ダッシュボードのカードを長押しして動かしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "한도에 가장 가까운 계정이 계정이 표시되는 모든 곳에서 먼저 옵니다. 끄면 순서는 직접 정합니다. 대시보드에서 카드를 길게 눌러 끌어 옮기세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A conta mais perto de um limite vem primeiro, em todos os lugares onde as contas aparecem. Desligado, a ordem é sua: segure um cartão no painel e arraste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最接近额度上限的账户排在最前，在所有列出账户的地方都是如此。关闭后顺序由你决定：在仪表板上长按卡片并拖动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resets %@" : {
      "comment" : "Reset line, absolute style, a week or more away: the date and time in one placeholder, e.g. \"Oct 31, 7:59 PM\". Same shape as \"Resets %@ %@\" (weekday, time).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reset %@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se reinicia %@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Recharge %@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@にリセット"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@에 초기화"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reinicia %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 重置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bars turn yellow above 70% used and red above 85%, so you see a limit coming." : {
      "comment" : "Tour step: what the bars' colors mean.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Balken werden über 70 % Nutzung gelb und über 85 % rot, damit du ein Limit kommen siehst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las barras se ponen amarillas por encima del 70 % usado y rojas por encima del 85 %, para que veas venir un límite."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les barres passent au jaune au-delà de 70 % d’utilisation et au rouge au-delà de 85 %, pour voir venir une limite."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用量が70%を超えるとバーは黄色に、85%を超えると赤になり、上限が近いことがわかります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사용량이 70%를 넘으면 막대가 노란색, 85%를 넘으면 빨간색이 되어 한도가 다가오는 것을 알 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As barras ficam amarelas acima de 70% de uso e vermelhas acima de 85%, para você ver um limite chegando."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用量超过 70% 时进度条变黄，超过 85% 时变红，让你提前看到额度将尽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Step %lld of %lld" : {
